# Prefer tools over CLI

When a dedicated tool can do the job, use it instead of `Shell`.

| Task | Use |
| --- | --- |
| Read a file | `Read` |
| Edit a file | `StrReplace` / `Write` |
| Find by name | `Glob` |
| Search contents | `Grep` |
| MCP / dynamic APIs | `GetDynamicTools` then `CallDynamicTool` |

Do not use `cat` / `sed` / `awk` / `head` / `tail` / shell `rg` / `find` for repo inspect/edit when the tools above work.

## Shell is correct for

- `cargo`, `./scripts/check.sh`, other project scripts
- `graphify` CLI (`query` / `path` / `explain` / update scripts)
- `git` (follow commit protocol in user rules)
- `gh` (issues, PRs, checks)
- Running the emulator binary and tests

## Do not contradict

- Never edit `.cursor/plans/`
- Pre-done Rust gate: `./scripts/check.sh` (`AGENTS.md`)
